      "text": "You should only use this tool, if you're\naware of the risks. Your Windows-OS\nwill be torn apart through the process.\nThere is also a slight chance of\nloosing all your data from the drive (in\nsome cases the drive itself), if\na power outage is envolved. Be aware...",
